# The catalog is TRACKED, whole. It is text — 528 skills × 3 brands, generated
# from the OpenAPI source of truth by hanzoai/openapi `skills.py` and refreshed
# here with `make skills`. Regenerate when the API surface moves; commit the diff
# and read it, because a skill is prose an agent follows.
#
# It used to arrive as a container image (ghcr.io/hanzoai/agent-skills) copied in
# at build time, with only a one-skill fallback tracked so a bare `go build` still
# worked. That put a cross-repo binary dependency between this repo and its own
# text: a package permission on a registry could — and did — stop 28 commits from
# building, and the failure surfaced as a 403 nowhere near the thing it broke.
# //go:embed reads what is here, so what is here is the whole set.
